# POE2Radar Rules Index

Always-on rules: **dual-input**, **performance**, **project-layout**, **threading-data-flow**, **automation-safety**, **security-privacy**, **change-discipline**, **git-workflow**.

| Rule file | When it applies |
|-----------|-----------------|
| `dual-input.mdc` | Hotkeys, gamepad, binding UIs |
| `performance.mdc` | Loops, cadence, CPU budget |
| `project-layout.mdc` | Core / Overlay / Research boundaries |
| `memory-offsets.mdc` | `Poe2Offsets`, `MemoryReader`, reads |
| `automation-safety.mdc` | Auto-flask, `SendInput` |
| `config-settings.mdc` | `RadarSettings`, migration, JSON |
| `api-dashboard.mdc` | `ApiServer`, `DashboardHtml` |
| `overlay-render.mdc` | ImGui, draw, assets, **settings accordion UI** |
| `threading-data-flow.mdc` | Snapshots, threads, shutdown |
| `testing.mdc` | xUnit, migrations |
| `csharp-style.mdc` | Naming, types, errors |
| `research-probes.mdc` | Research CLI, DevTree |
| `pathfinding-navigation.mdc` | A*, nav, atlas routes |
| `entity-display.mdc` | Display rules, styles |
| `loot-pricing.mdc` | Ground loot, poe.ninja |
| `atlas-overlay.mdc` | Atlas projection, graph |
| `map-viewport.mdc` | Map UI, minimap, viewport |
| `diagnostics.mdc` | CrashLog, startup errors |
| `dependencies-build.mdc` | csproj, NuGet, x64 |
| `security-privacy.mdc` | Localhost, read-only |
| `git-workflow.mdc` | Feature branches, test-before-merge |

Architecture reference: `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` (offsets, chain, probes). Rules govern **how we implement**; those docs govern **what the game layout is**.

**Product priorities:** (1) keyboard + Xbox parity, (2) ~0–2% CPU, (3) clean three-pillar structure.
